          "message": "First part of reorg source tree for expandability.\n\nMove 3rd party libraries to deps/ directory.\n\nMove gevent and greentest to src/ directory. This fixes tox.\n\nAt this point the builds should all work the same. Lets check.",
          "author": "Jason Madden",
          "date": "2016-04-05T15:34:49Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "29873ff4351a874606bd1c7bd7f11593569ec835",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/gevent/gevent/commit/29873ff4351a874606bd1c7bd7f11593569ec835",
          "message": "Stop trying to build gevent._corecffi on ImportError.\n\nWe now depend on CFFI/Python new enough that it should be built during\nsetup/installation.\n\nTrying to build at runtime easily results in \"gevent\" directories\nscattered all over the system.",
          "author": "Jason Madden",
          "date": "2016-03-22T22:48:38Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "3b27d976907e5e5b672d059e796a087a4174d9ac",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/gevent/gevent/commit/3b27d976907e5e5b672d059e796a087a4174d9ac",
          "message": "Save a tiny bit of memory in events by clearing the notifier.\n\nIt would become False anyway as soon as the method returned. We won't\nschedule another one while it's running (True), so there's no race\ncondition.",
          "author": "Jason Madden",
          "date": "2016-03-16T13:15:50Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "d6567bd1287365e083eb34939a713cfa667027ca",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/gevent/gevent/commit/d6567bd1287365e083eb34939a713cfa667027ca",
          "message": "try the build using prospector.",
          "author": "Jason Madden",
          "date": "2016-03-10T22:46:55Z"
        },
        {
          "sha": "69a53c6466c16512199c29db659729b07185116b",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/gevent/gevent/commit/69a53c6466c16512199c29db659729b07185116b",
          "message": "various module cleanups.\n\nclean up socketcommon.\ncleanup examples and servers.\ncleanup server\ncleanup util.\ncleanup sslgte279\ncleanup greentest.\ncleanup corecffi.\ncleanup fileobject.\ncleanup select.py\ncleanup socket2\nfix naming.\ncleanup socket3\ncleanup hub.\ncleanup threading.\ncleanup lock\ncleanup py",
          "author": "Jason Madden",
          "date": "2016-03-10T17:17:25Z"
        }
